| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: shipping.supp_nation ASC NULLS LAST, shipping.cust_nation ASC NULLS LAST, shipping.l_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   Projection: shipping.supp_nation, shipping.cust_nation, shipping.l_year, sum(shipping.volume) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[shipping.supp_nation, shipping.cust_nation, shipping.l_year]], aggr=[[sum(shipping.volume)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: shipping                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         Projection: n1.n_name AS supp_nation, n2.n_name AS cust_nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate) AS l_year, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Decimal128(Some(1),20,0) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount) AS volume                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           Inner Join: tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey Filter: n1.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |             Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate, tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey, n1.n_name                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |               Inner Join: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                 Projection: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate, tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                   Inner Join: tpch.tpch.orders.o_custkey = tpch.tpch.customer.c_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                     Projection: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate, tpch.tpch.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                       Inner Join: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_orderkey = tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                         Projection: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_orderkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                           Inner Join: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_suppkey = tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                             TableScan: tpch.tpch.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                             Filter: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate >= Date32("1995-01-01") AND tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate <= Date32("1996-12-31")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                               TableScan: tpch.tpch.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount, l_shipdate], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate >= Date32("1995-01-01"), tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_shipdate <= Date32("1996-12-31")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                         TableScan: tpch.tpch.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                     TableScan: tpch.tpch.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                   Filter: tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") OR tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     TableScan: tpch.tpch.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") OR tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |               Filter: tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 TableScan: tpch.tpch.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR tpch.tpch.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [supp_nation@0 ASC NULLS LAST, cust_nation@1 ASC NULLS LAST, l_year@2 ASC NULLS LAST]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   SortExec: expr=[supp_nation@0 ASC NULLS LAST, cust_nation@1 ASC NULLS LAST, l_year@2 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[supp_nation@0 as supp_nation, cust_nation@1 as cust_nation, l_year@2 as l_year, sum(shipping.volume)@3 as revenue]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[supp_nation@0 as supp_nation, cust_nation@1 as cust_nation, l_year@2 as l_year], aggr=[sum(shipping.volume)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([supp_nation@0, cust_nation@1, l_year@2], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[supp_nation@0 as supp_nation, cust_nation@1 as cust_nation, l_year@2 as l_year], aggr=[sum(shipping.volume)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[n_name@0 as supp_nation, n_name@1 as cust_nation, date_part(YEAR, l_shipdate@2) as l_year, l_extendedprice@3 * (Some(1),20,0 - l_discount@4) as volume]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(c_nationkey@3, n_nationkey@0)], filter=n_name@0 = FRANCE AND n_name@1 = GERMANY OR n_name@0 = GERMANY AND n_name@1 = FRANCE, projection=[n_name@4, n_name@6, l_shipdate@2, l_extendedprice@0, l_discount@1]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([c_nationkey@3], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                   HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(s_nationkey@0, n_nationkey@0)], projection=[l_extendedprice@1, l_discount@2, l_shipdate@3, c_nationkey@4, n_name@6]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                     RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([s_nationkey@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                       HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(o_custkey@4, c_custkey@0)], projection=[s_nationkey@0, l_extendedprice@1, l_discount@2, l_shipdate@3, c_nationkey@6]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([o_custkey@4], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                           HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(l_orderkey@1, o_orderkey@0)], projection=[s_nationkey@0, l_extendedprice@2, l_discount@3, l_shipdate@4, o_custkey@6]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                             RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([l_orderkey@1], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                               HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(s_suppkey@0, l_suppkey@1)], projection=[s_nationkey@1, l_orderkey@2, l_extendedprice@4, l_discount@5, l_shipdate@6]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
